# Shopify Storefront API (optional).
#
# Set both variables to serve the catalog live from Shopify and enable the hosted
# checkout. Leave them unset and the site runs on the local catalog in
# data/products.js, with checkout replaced by a "contact us" message.
#
# Where to get them:
#   1. Shopify admin -> Settings -> Apps and sales channels -> Develop apps
#   2. Create an app, then under "Storefront API" grant: unauthenticated_read_product_listings,
#      unauthenticated_read_product_inventory, unauthenticated_write_checkouts
#   3. Install the app and copy the Storefront API access token
#
# The Storefront token is a public token, but keep it out of the client bundle
# anyway — lib/shopify.js only ever runs on the server.

SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN=
